It is now the month of March.
The weather in Mumbai is very hot now.
There is bright sunshine early in the morning.
I get ready for the office.
I open my wardrobe.
I take out my blue jeans.
These jeans are very thick.
I put on these thick jeans.
I immediately feel very hot.
I take off these jeans.
I put on thin pants.
It is summer in Mumbai now.
My heavy clothes are not good now.
I do not have cotton clothes.
I need light cotton clothes.
I need new clothes for the office.
I go to the market this evening.
